flowchart TB
subgraph fairness_status["Establish legal position"]
f1["Identify appointment instrument, term and holdover<br/>HPCAA ss120-122"]
f2["Identify actual grounds and personal interests affected<br/>Wyeth paras40-42"]
f1 --> f2
end
subgraph fairness_response["Where fairness requires a response"]
f3["Communicate substance of material adverse concerns<br/>Conditional natural justice"]
f4["Allow a meaningful opportunity to respond<br/>Conditional natural justice"]
f5["Genuinely consider the response before deciding<br/>Conditional natural justice"]
f3 --> f4
f4 --> f5
end
subgraph fairness_record["Decision and accountability"]
f6["Give the applicable statutory notification<br/>HPCAA ss121-122"]
f7["Record reasons and explain the change appropriately<br/>Proposed transparency safeguard"]
f6 --> f7
end
fairness_condition{Response opportunity required?}
f2 --> fairness_condition
fairness_condition -->|Where required| f3
fairness_condition -->|No such duty established| f6
f5 --> f6
